{"articleNo":"2413","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2413&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"★ 생활관 입사자 건강진단(간염검사지) 재활용 ★","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.01.13","hit":"12340","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">생활관 입사자 건강진단(간염검사지) 재활용</span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;2009-2학기와 2010-1학기에 연속하여 생활관을 입사하는 관생은 건강진단서 중 간염검사는 재활용이 가능하므로 재활용 대상자는 아래 사항을 참고하시어, 생활관 행정실에서 서류를 찾아 재활용하시기 바랍니다.(결핵검사지와 등본은 재활용 안됨) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">○ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">항체(＋, 양성)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">,</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 항원(－, 음성)일 경우 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">간염검사(재활용가능)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">없이 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">결핵검사</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">만 합니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">○ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">항체(－, 음성)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">,</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 항원(－, 음성)일 경우 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">간염검사, 결핵검사 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2가지를 합니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">단, 간염검사지의 유효기간은 발급일로부터 1년임.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">※ 2010-1학기 신규 입사자는 진단서(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">간염과 결핵</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">) 및 등본을 제출하여야 합니다.<br><br><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2010.1<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교생활관장</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
